
WINDOWS SERVER 2025 ACTIVE DIRECTORY HOME LAB

PROJECT OVERVIEW

This project documents my hands-on Active Directory home lab built using UTM on a Mac mini.

The purpose of this lab was to build a small business-style Windows environment and practice real-world IT Support, Help Desk, System Administration, Active Directory, DNS, Group Policy, user management, authentication, networking, and security troubleshooting.

LAB ENVIRONMENT

Host:
- Mac mini
- 24 GB RAM
- UTM virtualization software
- External SSD used for VM storage

Domain Controller:
- Windows Server 2025
- Hostname: DC01
- Domain: matthias.local
- IP Address: 192.168.64.2
- Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.0
- Default Gateway: 192.168.64.1
- Preferred DNS: 192.168.64.2

Windows Client:
- Windows 11 Pro
- Domain: matthias.local
- DNS: 192.168.64.2

